    "name": "Potatogeddon",
    "steam_appid": 3353000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353000/extras/50e42e4966763f0e23423f476955760d.avif?t=1753978950\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for a potato revolution?</strong> Step into the role of an extraordinary hero \u2013 a potato who infiltrates the secret base of potato beetles and other creatures feeding on delicious and magnificent potatoes to stop their sinister plan to destroy the world's potato crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potatogeddon</strong> is a dynamic first-person FPS game with roguelike elements that will immerse you in fast-paced action and humorous battles. Explore procedurally generated corridors of the enemy base, collect unique upgrades, and fight hordes of enraged beetles, mutants, and mechanical creatures standing in your way. Each attempt to beat the game is a completely new experience \u2013 with randomly generated levels, enemies, and items, no two runs are ever the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, crazy FPS action</strong> \u2013 shoot, dodge, and fight against enemies in intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> \u2013 each playthrough offers new challenges, unique level layouts, and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike elements</strong> \u2013 face new combinations of upgrades, enemies, and challenges with every attempt, making each run a unique experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode for up to 4 players</strong> \u2013 join forces with friends to avoid annihilation. Defeat enemies together and become potato heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humorous tone and stylized graphics</strong> \u2013 a comedic approach to a serious mission combined with a unique art style makes the game perfect for solo players and teams alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge in <i>Potatogeddon</i> and prove that the potato is king! \ud83e\udd54</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353000/extras/50e42e4966763f0e23423f476955760d.avif?t=1753978950\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for a potato revolution?</strong> Step into the role of an extraordinary hero \u2013 a potato who infiltrates the secret base of potato beetles and other creatures feeding on delicious and magnificent potatoes to stop their sinister plan to destroy the world's potato crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potatogeddon</strong> is a dynamic first-person FPS game with roguelike elements that will immerse you in fast-paced action and humorous battles. Explore procedurally generated corridors of the enemy base, collect unique upgrades, and fight hordes of enraged beetles, mutants, and mechanical creatures standing in your way. Each attempt to beat the game is a completely new experience \u2013 with randomly generated levels, enemies, and items, no two runs are ever the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, crazy FPS action</strong> \u2013 shoot, dodge, and fight against enemies in intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> \u2013 each playthrough offers new challenges, unique level layouts, and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike elements</strong> \u2013 face new combinations of upgrades, enemies, and challenges with every attempt, making each run a unique experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode for up to 4 players</strong> \u2013 join forces with friends to avoid annihilation. Defeat enemies together and become potato heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humorous tone and stylized graphics</strong> \u2013 a comedic approach to a serious mission combined with a unique art style makes the game perfect for solo players and teams alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge in <i>Potatogeddon</i> and prove that the potato is king! \ud83e\udd54</p>",
    "short_description": "Take on the role of a potato and become a hero! Explore generated levels, develop skills, fight against enemies. Play solo or gather a team. The potato revolution is waiting for you! Take up the challenge in Potatogeddon and prove that the potato is king! \ud83e\udd54",
